#: xmms/equalizer.c:1681
msgid ""
"If \"Auto\" is enabled on the equalizer, xmms will try to load equalizer "
"presets like this:\n"
"1: Look for a preset file in the directory of the file we are about to "
"play.\n"
"2: Look for a directory preset file in the same directory.\n"
"3: Look for a preset saved with the \"auto-load\" feature\n"
"4: Finally, try to load the \"default\" preset"
msgstr ""
"Če je v izenačevalniku omogočeno \"Samodejno\", bo XMMS poskušal naložiti "
"prednastavitve tako:\n"
"1: Poišče prednastavitveno datoteko v imeniku datoteke, ki jo želite "
"predvajati.\n"
"2: V istem imeniku poišče imenik prednastavitvene datoteke.\n"
"3: Poišče prednastavitev, shranjeno z možnostjo \"samodejno nalaganje\".\n"
"4: Končno poskuša naložiti \"privzeto\" prednastavitev."

